OL,3,GNEWSAThree men jailed for 'sectarian'
OL,4,Aattack on Celtic fan after Old Firm
OL,5,Aclash
OL,6,
OL,7,FThree men from Northern Ireland have
OL,8,Fbeen jailed for attacking a Celtic fan
OL,9,Fafter a an Old Firm clash at Ibrox
OL,10,Fwhich culminated in a mass pitch
OL,11,Finvasion.
OL,13,FScott Dragsness, 55, Andrew Graham, 21,
OL,14,Fand Ben Stanex, 24, left the
OL,15,F48-year-old fan with a bleed on the
OL,16,Fbrain after targeting him as he tried
OL,17,Fto board a supporters' bus after the
OL,18,FScottish Cup tie on 8 March.
OL,23,APub: 28-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB  Scot NewsC Reg TVF  Weather
FL,424,420,260,160,0,100
